Subject: [PATCH] Add negotiated opt-in directory attribute invalidation

Namespace events cannot change directory owner/mode/ACL. With
--notify-dir-cache, invalidate directory contents, size, links and times
without expiring permission attrs. ATTRIB and file data events retain full
invalidation. Require private feature bit 2 so older guests fail closed.

